  "content_html": "<p></p><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/66292ef4b94c733919.jpg\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/66292ef4b94c733919.jpg\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">קורס צוערים</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַל תִּירְאוּ וְאַל תַּעַרְצוּ מִפְּנֵיהֶם</span></blockquote><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #202122;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: Rubik;\">💔</span></span><b style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">לַעֲרֹץ</b><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> פירושו לְפַחֵד ולהישבר</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #202122;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">. זו גם משמעות הפסוק \"</span></span></span></span><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יְמִינְךָ ה' <b>תִּרְעַץ</b> אוֹיֵב\" (ערץ-רעץ)</span></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> </span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #202122;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: Rubik;\">⚔️</span>השליט המושל באמצעות השלטת מורא ופחד</span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">, הנו </span><b style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">עָרִיץ</b><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #202122;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: Rubik;\">🙀</span>העם הַמְּפֻחָד והכנוע</span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"color: #202122;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">- </span><b style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">מַעֲרִיץ</b><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> (בעל-כורחו) את כוחו של ה</span></span></span></span><b style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">עָרִיץ</b><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: Rubik;\">👑</span>המושל או השולט </span></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">מכונה גם </span><b style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">עוֹצֵר</b><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">. (בשיכול האותיות צ-ר).</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: Rubik;\">⛓️</span>השליטה </span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">מושגת ע\"י <b>הצרת</b> צעדי המתנגדים, ו<b>עֲצִירָתָם</b> </span></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">בבתי </span><b style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">מַעֲצָר</b><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">. </span></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">שימו לב למילים </span><b style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">צַר</b><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> וְ</span><b style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">צָרָה</b><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> המשובצות בכל התיבות הללו - כמו גם במילה <b>צַעַר</b>.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: Rubik;\">♒</span><b>עֲרוּץ</b> נחל </span></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">הנו תוואי שהנחל </span><b style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">חוקק, שובר ונוקב</b><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> באדמה ע\"י כוח זרימת מימיו.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: Rubik;\">👂</span>עבד </span><b style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">נִרְצָע</b><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> הוא עבד שאדונו <b>רָצַע</b> (<b>ניקב/חקק</b>) את אוזנו</span></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: Rubik;\">🦯</span>לא כדאי להישען על </span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"color: #1f1f1f;\">קָנֶה&nbsp;</span><b style=\"color: #1f1f1f;\">רָצוּץ</b><span style=\"color: #1f1f1f;\">&nbsp;- כלומר לסמוך על משענת&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"color: #1f1f1f;\">חלשה ושבירה.<br /></span></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>רְצִיצָה</b>&nbsp;היא פעולת שבירה דבר לחלקים, כמוזכר בעמוס \"</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #202122; text-align: -webkit-center;\">הָעֹשְׁקוֹת דַּלִּים <b>הָרֹצְצוֹת</b> אֶבְיוֹנִים\"</span><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #1f1f1f;\">.</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"color: #1f1f1f;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">👮</span><b>צוֹעֵר</b>&nbsp;הוא חייל <b>צָעִיר</b>&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #1f1f1f; font-family: arial;\">המתחנך בבית ספר לקצינים.<br />אך האם יש קשר בין צער לצעיר?<br /></span></span><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #1f1f1f; font-family: arial;\">המשנה במסכת ערכין מזכירה את </span><b style=\"background-color: white; color: #1f1f1f; font-family: arial;\">צוערי הלוויים</b><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #1f1f1f; font-family: arial;\"> (לווים צעירים).<br /></span><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #1f1f1f; font-family: arial;\">פרשנים רבים קושרים - באופן מרתק - את המילה </span><b style=\"background-color: white; color: #1f1f1f; font-family: arial;\">צעיר </b><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #1f1f1f; font-family: arial;\">למילה </span><b style=\"background-color: white; color: #1f1f1f; font-family: arial;\">צער</b><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #1f1f1f; font-family: arial;\">, ומסבירים כי קולם הנעים והֶעָרֵב&nbsp;של הלוויים הצעירים - מצער את הלוויים הבוגרים (שקולם כבר הצטרד), וגורם לקנאתם.</span></span></p>"
}
